"""The first ArchHub application lens over the universal-cell runtime.

This module does not introduce application node classes. It composes ordinary
four-field Cells into an application root, a canvas relation, a wired
Properties lens, visual position properties, and first-class canvas relations.
The projection functions interpret only graph-supplied role identities.
"""
